## Summary Checklist

- [ ] Theme type inference setup (no circular references)
- [ ] Props are optional with default values (for forwardRef compatibility)
- [ ] Style logic separated into functions
- [ ] Type assertion `as ComponentType` used
- [ ] Component composition uses simple wrappers (no redundant forwardRef)
- [ ] Only `@emotion/react` dependency (styled is optional)
- [ ] Full TypeScript type safety maintained
- [ ] ref forwarding works automatically
- [ ] Icon components use type-safe name mapping with iconMap
- [ ] External icon libraries wrapped with span for ref and style support

This pattern is production-tested and used by major Korean tech companies (Toss, Kakao, Daangn).
